  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic swamps on the edge of Subchain City, 'Gravewalker' Gus has seen more death than most ducks his age. His early life scavenging for scraps led him to an encounter with a mysterious artifact tainted by the Echo Stain, granting him unusual abilities, but also an insatiable hunger.",
    "class": "Shadow Stalker",
    "name": "Gravewalker Gus",
    "personality": "Gravewalker Gus is haunted by the constant echoes of the dead, making him withdrawn and brooding. He trusts few ducks and prefers to operate alone, often muttering cryptic warnings only he seems to understand. Despite his grim demeanor, there's a flicker of dry humor beneath the surface - a coping mechanism honed by years of survival.",
